# Pairs with NoKeyLost. The saga acknowledges the batch whatever it decided,
# so an aborted batch is acknowledged and no shard holds it.
MODULE: NoKeyLostFoldAbortAcknowledged
TARGET: NoKeyLost
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an aborted saga acknowledges its caller as if it had committed
PERTURBS: SagaComplete

--- FIND
    /\ ackOn' = IF dec = "committed" THEN [k \in Keys |-> Max(ackOn[k], Rank(SagaV))] ELSE ackOn
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: acknowledged whatever the decision.
    /\ ackOn' = [k \in Keys |-> Max(ackOn[k], Rank(SagaV))]
--- END
